     "caption": "Magic e changes the word.",
     "alt": "Four boxes showing words and their magic e partners."
    },
    {
     "type": "key",
     "style": "retenir",
     "title": "Pairs",
     "md": "a-e: cap, cape; mat, mate. i-e: kit, kite; bit, bite. o-e: hop, hope; not, note. u-e: cub, cube; tub, tube."
    },
    {
     "type": "key",
     "style": "pieges",
     "title": "Common mistakes",
     "md": "- The e at the end is silent. Do not say it.\n- Magic e works on the vowel before it.\n- Not all words follow the rule, e.g. *have*."
    },
    {
